// Conformance fixture for MMA/after.py (AFTER directive).
// Exercises Bar=, Count=, Repeat=, Id=/Remove and Bar=EOF, plus the
// recurse path (an event due in the middle of a '*' repeat).
//
// NOTE: in this Python version Bar=<n> never fires: after.py assigns
// dat.bar only inside the `if opt < 1:` error branch, so the event is
// stored with bar=None.  The Bar=3 line below is inert on both sides -
// it is here to pin that behaviour.
Time 4
TimeSig 4 4
Tempo 100
KeySig C
RndSeed 1
Groove SWING

// fixed bar trigger (inert in the reference implementation)
After Bar=3 Groove ROCK1

// relative triggers
After Count=2 Volume FF
After Repeat=2 Id=VOL Volume M

// fires in the middle of the C * 4 line below (recurse path)
After Count=9 Volume ppp

// queued at end of file
After Bar=EOF MidiText END

C
C
C
C
C
C
C
C

// stop the repeating volume event, then repeat a bar
After Remove=VOL

C * 4
z
